  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// Region nesting deeper than the restart int can describe.')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('//')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// The lexer pushes a context frame per nested "region": a children region')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// (`<ul>` … `</ul>`), a braced attribute value (`className={…}`), and a')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// template interpolation (`${…}`). The frame stack is a plain array with no')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// bound; only its packed form — bits 8..31 of the restart int, three bytes —')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// is limited, and that form is a hint nothing reads back.')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('//')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// Consecutive unbraced nesting is free: `<a><b><c>` shares one frame via a')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// child count. A frame is pushed only when a region opens inside something')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// that is not already a depth-0 children region — so it is the alternation')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// children > brace > children > brace that costs frames, which is exactly what')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// ordinary React markup does, and why three was never enough.')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('//')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// bsc accepts every line below.')
  PsiComment(LINE_COMMENT)('// Three regions — children > attribute > interpolation. Fits the packed form.')
